109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TKA6rgjpoJwQ7kNvwHcUSz7&_nc_oc=Adp1wAa7XeWAl_EfIyHtPmExnr2VsjABkBd1hz3KJ0inODxJymGAIa1d_Ds5k7UoZNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1Vk0EFQdNElqL80KKs4cGHHR3q_LuT2jAluIEO424Vbw&oe=69E0D9E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "NBA: Live Games and Scores", "keywords": ["basketball", "fantasy", "leaguepass", "sports", "streaming"], "long_description": "# **Live games. All season. All here.**\n\nWatch live games with NBA League Pass and get access to your favorite NBA teams and players. NBA League Pass subscribers have access to:\n- Streaming NBA games live and on-demand*\n- Alternate streams\n- Data overlays of player stats and scores of other games without leaving the game\n- Watch up to 3 games simultaneously with multiview\n- Local language broadcasts\n\n*Blackouts and restrictions apply in the US and Canada.\n\nCurrent NBA League Pass subscribers can access their subscription by visiting their NBA.com profile. \n\nNew NBA League Pass subscriptions can be set up by visiting NBA.com. \n\nPurchase NBA League Pass and you will be automatically billed every 30 days (monthly packages) or every 365 days (annual packages) until you cancel your subscription. Refunds are not available after subscriptions have been activated.\n\nPlease visit NBA Help Center (http://support.watch.nba.com/) to contact the support team if you are experiencing any issues.", "short_description": "Live games. All season. All here. \n\nWatch live games with NBA League Pass and get access to your favorite NBA teams and players. NBA League Pass subscribers have access to:\nStreaming NBA games live and on-demand*\nAlternate streams \nData overlays of player stats and scores of other games without leaving the game\nWatch up to 3 games simultaneously with multiview\nLocal language broadcasts\n*Blackouts and restrictions apply in the US and Canada."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_po